The Minister of Science and ICT shall entrust the following duties to the Korea Internet and Security Agency pursuant to Article 23 of the Act:
Provision of assistance in respect of the matters specified in subparagraphs 2 through 4 of Article 5 of the Act;
Establishment of operating standards for electronic-signature certification services pursuant to Article 7 (2) of the Act.

